<ArticleLayout
  title="What Is Behavioral Psychology? Definition and Basics"
  description="Behavioral psychology studies how environment shapes behavior. Learn its definition, key principles, history, and real-world applications."
  date="2026-11-03"
  heroImage="/images/hero-what-is-behavioral-psychology.webp"
  heroAlt="Open book introducing behavioral psychology"
  deck="Behavioral psychology is one of the oldest and most influential schools in the field. It studies how the environment shapes observable behavior, and its principles quietly power everything from classroom teaching to advertising. Here is the full picture: the definition, the key principles, the history, and where you can see it at work."
  figcaption="An open book is a fitting symbol for behavioral psychology: the field treats behavior as something to be observed, recorded, and studied, page by page."
  toc={toc}
